<title>HUNGARY: All three Hungary BUBOR rates decline.</title>
<headline>All three Hungary BUBOR rates decline.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased on Monday for all three maturities, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.77 percent, down 0.01, the three-month rate at 20.62 percent, down 0.06 while the six-month rate was set at 20.26 percent, down 0.18.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
